<h2 data-start="6952" data-end="7013"><strong data-start="6955" data-end="7013">6. Empirical Predictions that Could Falsify Barenholtz</strong></h2>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="7015" data-end="7742" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="7015" data-end="7059"><tr data-start="7015" data-end="7059"><th data-start="7015" data-end="7023" data-col-size="sm">Claim</th><th data-start="7023" data-end="7043" data-col-size="md">Experimental Test</th><th data-start="7043" data-end="7059" data-col-size="sm">Falsified If</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="7074" data-end="7742"><tr data-start="7074" data-end="7203"><td data-start="7074" data-end="7109" data-col-size="sm">Holographic trajectory templates</td><td data-start="7109" data-end="7161" data-col-size="md">Recovery of algorithms from distributed weak cues</td><td data-start="7161" data-end="7203" data-col-size="sm">Only strong local cues enable recovery</td></tr><tr data-start="7204" data-end="7332"><td data-start="7204" data-end="7246" data-col-size="sm">Attention ≈ posterior over trajectories</td><td data-start="7246" data-end="7304" data-col-size="md">Probe maps attention → true latent trajectory posterior</td><td data-start="7304" data-end="7332" data-col-size="sm">Probe performs at chance</td></tr><tr data-start="7333" data-end="7448"><td data-start="7333" data-end="7363" data-col-size="sm">Reasoning uses sparse paths</td><td data-start="7363" data-end="7408" data-col-size="md">Sparsity regularization improves inference</td><td data-start="7408" data-end="7448" data-col-size="sm">Sparsity reliably degrades reasoning</td></tr><tr data-start="7449" data-end="7585"><td data-start="7449" data-end="7482" data-col-size="sm">Trajectories refine over depth</td><td data-start="7482" data-end="7557" data-col-size="md">Linear probes decode trajectory state increasingly well at deeper layers</td><td data-start="7557" data-end="7585" data-col-size="sm">No monotonic improvement</td></tr><tr data-start="7586" data-end="7742"><td data-start="7586" data-end="7617" data-col-size="sm">Cultural trajectories differ</td><td data-start="7617" data-end="7698" data-col-size="md">Models trained on distinct linguistic cultures learn distinct reasoning biases</td><td data-start="7698" data-end="7742" data-col-size="sm">All models converge to same trajectories</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.63025 16.7797 4.91211 16.8027C5.29563 16.8341 5.78896 16.835 6.5 16.835H9.33301C10.0439 16.835 10.5374 16.8341 10.9209 16.8027C11.2965 16.772 11.508 16.7152 11.666 16.6348L11.793 16.5645C12.0804 16.3881 12.3148 16.1351 12.4688 15.833L12.5244 15.7031C12.5759 15.5594 12.6137 15.3698 12.6367 15.0879C12.6681 14.7044 12.668 14.211 12.668 13.5V10.667ZM13.998 12.665C14.4528 12.6634 14.8011 12.6602 15