</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\part</span></span><span>{Falsification Regime}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{Core falsifiable claims}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{enumerate}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Posterior-in-attention:} A linear probe on attention logits </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{t}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> predicts analytic posterior </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>p(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\omega</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mid</span></span><span> x</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\le</span></span><span> t})</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> with </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>R</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2 &gt; 0.6</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Sparse trajectory hypothesis:} Attention entropy </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>H(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> negatively correlates with algorithmic accuracy.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Geodesic reasoning:} Reasoning paths produce low-curvature embedding trajectories:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\[</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\kappa</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\approx</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{KL}(p</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{x'}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span>p</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>x)+</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{KL}(p</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{x''}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span>p</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{x'})-</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{KL}(p</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{x''}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span>p</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>x) </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\approx</span></span><span> 0.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Model-of-model learning:} Probing for </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\theta</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\to</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\theta</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{t+1}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> dynamics outperforms probing only </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>x</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\to</span></span><span> x</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{t+1}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> at predicting token continuations.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Head-as-hypothesis test:} Pruning top-</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>k</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> inactive heads does not reduce next-token likelihood, but pruning top-</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>k</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> active heads does.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{enumerate}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{Minimal experimental suite}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>{Probe 1 — Attention → Posterior}
Train </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>f</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{probe}}(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t) </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\to</span></span><span> p(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\omega</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mid</span></span><span> x</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\le</span></span><span> t})</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>. Report KL and </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>R</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>{Probe 2 — Curvature vs reasoning}
Compute </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\kappa</span></span><span>(x,x',x'')</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> along chain-of-thought trajectories; test </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbb</span></span><span>{E}[</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\kappa</span></span><span>]</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\approx</span></span><span> 0</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>{Intervention 1 — Sparsity forcing}
At inference, impose:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\[</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\leftarrow</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{top-k}(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t),
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>
test impact on accuracy.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>{Intervention 2 — Head ablation}
Ablate head set </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{H}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>, measure:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\[</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Delta</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{NLL}(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{H}) </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\gg</span></span><span> 0 </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\quad</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{if head is hypothesis-critical}.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{Failure modes that would falsify the theory}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{itemize}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> Attention representations cannot predict analytic posteriors above chance.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> Reasoning trajectories show high curvature discontinuities.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> Sparsity forcing causes catastrophic accuracy collapse.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> No subset of heads behaves as reusable subroutine hypotheses.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> Model-of-model probes do not outperform token-level probes.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{itemize}

